  "passage": "Subject: My New Volunteer Job! Hi Sam, Hope you're doing well! I wanted to tell you about my new volunteer work at the City Wildlife Park. It's terrific! I work with the animals and help visitors. The job is rather busy, but I love it because I learn so much about wildlife. My ambition is to become a zoologist one day, so this experience is perfect. I prefer working outdoors rather than in an office. The staff have a positive attitude, which makes it even better. They are very supportive. Last week, we had a school group visit. One student asked where the toilet was, and I showed them. It was funny because they were more interested in the monkeys than the facilities! I enjoyed chatting with them. How are things with you? Still thinking about that full-time job offer? Let me know soon. Best, Alex",
